{
	$version: "0.1.71.1"
	name: "03: Production"
	category: "00: Essentials"
	desc:
		'''
		Buildings and industry allow you to create resources and goods.
		Reading descriptions may give you a general idea of what something does. Everything has tutorial pages which offer more detailed breakdowns.
		'''
	
	order: 3
	size: [456, 0]
	layout: a
	flags: none
	
	title: "Production and Refinement"
	sprite_scale: 6
	sprite:
	{
		texture: ui_icons_widget
		size: [16, 16]
		frame: [13, 4]
	}
	entries:
	[
		{
			text: "With a pickaxe you can dig stone, this will provide basic resources for construction. You can also loot mines for resources."
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bullet
		}
		{
			text: "A Handgrinder can grind resources, providing ores, compounds, and cement depending on what you put into it."
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bullet
		}
		{
			text: "Furnaces smelt ores in its inventory into ingots for general use and produce karban."
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bullet
		}
		{
			text: "Cauldrons produce explosive compounds and various chemicals required for certain crafts."
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bullet
		}
		{
			text: "A Buildery can be constructed for more specialized tools."
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bullet
		}
		{
			text: "An Armory will provide basic weaponry and better equipment."
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bullet
		}
	]
}